WEBVTT

00:11:30.863 --> 00:11:32.530
"What does what feel like?"

00:11:33.030 --> 00:11:34.497
"Cancer.

00:11:34.530 --> 00:11:36.430
What does your cancer feel like?"

00:11:38.963 --> 00:11:41.297
"Fire," she said.

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:47.430
"My bones are on fire
and everywhere under my skin is burning.

00:11:47.463 --> 00:11:50.463
And every time I move,
it just makes it worse.

00:11:50.463 --> 00:11:52.563
My whole body is on fire."

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:57.297
After a moment,

00:11:57.330 --> 00:12:00.530
she said, "Are you mad at me?"